---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
---
<Base title="Apply" description="Request a Kingdom Factor fit conversation and clarify the right next step for your leadership season." canonical="/apply/">
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Fit conversation"
    title="Ensure you're in the room where wisdom surrounds you."
    text="A fit conversation helps you clarify your next step, whether that's a peer advisory group, executive coaching, marketplace ministry resources, or another path that best supports the decisions you are carrying."
    primary={{ label: "See conversation path", href: "#conversation-path" }}
    secondary={{ label: "Compare the two lanes", href: "/" }}
  />
  <section id="conversation-path" class="content-section offer-detail-section apply-path-section">
    <div class="section-header compact">
      <p class="eyebrow">What to expect</p>
      <h2>A simple path to discern the right room.</h2>
      <p>No pressure, no generic pitch. The first step is clarity about your leadership season, the weight of your decisions, and the kind of counsel that would actually help.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content-grid apply-path-grid">
      <article class="content-card premium-card">
        <span class="card-number">01</span>
        <h3>Share the season</h3>
        <p>Identify the decisions, pressures, people questions, growth constraints, or faith-and-work tensions that are currently on the table.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="content-card premium-card">
        <span class="card-number">02</span>
        <h3>Clarify the room</h3>
        <p>Compare peer advisory, private executive coaching, peer community, marketplace ministry resources, or a lighter leadership-circle path.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="content-card premium-card">
        <span class="card-number">03</span>
        <h3>Choose the next step</h3>
        <p>If there is a fit, Kingdom Factor can recommend the right conversation, room, or resource path for the season you are leading through.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
